Description:It is your upkeep. You control Omen Machine and two Mountains and have Lava Spike in hand; the top card of your library is Terminus. The opponent controls Sphere of Resistance and is at 3 life. Win this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-ea0b3972db8a758d | Casting without paying the mana cost still adds Sphere of Resistance's {1} (CR 118.9d, 601.2f), and a player is never required to activate mana abilities to pay a cost (CR 118.3c, 601.2g): decline Terminus's tax and keep both Mountains for Lava Spike
